Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: preserve legacy advertising intent across active scan

Pause only the legacy shared-address advertising transaction while preparing
an active scan. Restore management intent and wall-clock expiry without
spending another rotation slice, and reconcile final shared random address
with the existing public scan fallback and RPA cache. Retain elapsed expiry
authority across timer allocation/submit failures with bounded retry.
Commit explicit armed/deadline ownership under the device lock so canceled
callbacks cannot truncate a pending replacement or consume a fresh slice.

Changes internal hci_dev state: build the complete matching kernel and all
modules, then export the matching SDK and image. This is not a claim to fix
controller Hardware Error 0x00.

Base: Raspberry Pi Linux 95b85bebbedcaedfa7ca79116ed38b7376fba412.
Apply after the existing four WendyOS Raspberry Pi recipe patches.
Upstream-Status: Pending
Frozen raw patch SHA256: f335dd20b1ad9fe1c3079819278ff65bca330e59c8e61eaaba01f382dde76d81

